<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Service Center</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-purple: #cbbdf0;
            --hover-purple: #b8a9e0;
            --bg-body: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #2d3748;
            --text-sub: #718096;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        body.dark-theme {
            --bg-body: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-main: #f1f5f9;
            --text-sub: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        body, html {
            min-height: 100vh;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-body) !important;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .theme-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--text-main);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .landing-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1000px;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .logo-box {
            background-color: var(--primary-purple);
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(203, 189, 240, 0.4);
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .content-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            align-items: flex-start; 
            justify-content: center;
            width: 100%;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        .left-column {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .main-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 32px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .btn-login, .btn-register {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .btn-login {
            margin-bottom: 15px; 
        }

        .btn-register {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn-login:hover, .btn-register:hover {
            background-color: var(--hover-purple);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .info-section {
            text-align: left;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 25px;
        }

        .info-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .info-icon {
            color: var(--primary-purple);
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .info-text b {
            display: block;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .info-text span {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .right-column {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 450px;
            text-align: left;
            padding-top: 10px; 
        }

        .right-column h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .right-column p {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 35px 0;
        }

        .feature-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .feature-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .feature-icon-box {
            color: var(--primary-purple);
            background: rgba(203, 189, 240, 0.15);
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 18px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .content-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 50px;
            }
            .right-column {
                text-align: center;
                padding-top: 0;
            }
            .feature-list li {
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: left;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="theme-toggle" onclick="document.body.classList.toggle('dark-theme')">
        <i class="fas fa-moon"></i>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-wrapper">
        
        <div class="header-section">
            <div class="logo-box">
                <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
            </div>
            <h1 class="brand-name">Service Center</h1>
            <p class="tagline">Professional Service</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-section">
            
            <div class="left-column">
                <div class="main-card">
                    <a href="/auth/login" class="btn-login">
                        <span>Log In</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/auth/register" class="btn-register">
                        <span>Create Account</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i>
                    </a>

                    <div class="info-section">
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-clock info-icon"></i>
                            <div class="info-text">
                                <b>We are open</b>
                                <span>Mon-Fri: 09:00 — 19:00<br>Sat: 10:00 — 15:00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt info-icon"></i>
                            <div class="info-text">
                                <b>Our Address</b>
                                <span>King Danylo Uni, Ivano-Frankivsk</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt info-icon"></i>
                            <div class="info-text">
                                <b>Quality Guarantee</b>
                                <span>We provide a warranty on all types of repair work for up to 6 months.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="right-column">
                <h2>Reliable Repair Management</h2>
                <p>Our platform is designed for seamless interaction between clients and technicians. Track your device's status, get real-time updates, and manage all your requests in one place.</p>
                
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-laptop-medical"></i></div>
                        Fast online repair requests
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-search"></i></div>
                        Transparent progress tracking
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="feature-icon-box"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></div>
                        Direct communication with staff
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

        </div> </div>

</body>
</html>